commit 356b7fc5e169c091e467a75559cf415c1ba476e5
Author: Lance Colton <lance.colton@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Jun 26 12:04:53 2026 -0700

    feat(etf): enhance ETF context handling and reporting

    - Introduced new functions to aggregate ETF changes and parse ETF tickers from URLs.
    - Updated the ETF context formatting to include summaries, notable trades, and relevant articles.
    - Refactored the ETF trades retrieval logic to improve data handling and presentation.
    - Adjusted front-end components to reflect changes in ETF activity terminology.

    These enhancements provide a more comprehensive view of ETF activities and improve user experience in the dashboard.

